1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,858
From orbit,
this part of Mars

2
00:00:01,939 --> 00:00:03,518
looked like
nothing special.

3
00:00:03,901 --> 00:00:05,445
The camera up
there can spot

4
00:00:05,492 --> 00:00:07,872
the rover itself,
this dark dot.

5
00:00:08,382 --> 00:00:09,323
But it couldn't
make out

6
00:00:09,369 --> 00:00:10,983
the stones
on the ground.

7
00:00:11,424 --> 00:00:13,201
Then Curiosity
drove in.

8
00:00:13,642 --> 00:00:15,279
The channel floor
was covered

9
00:00:15,314 --> 00:00:16,544
in bright
stones.

10
00:00:16,823 --> 00:00:18,274
Their outsides
were white

11
00:00:18,321 --> 00:00:19,540
and full
of holes.

12
00:00:19,865 --> 00:00:21,781
Inside,
yellow crystals

13
00:00:21,839 --> 00:00:23,754
of pure sulfur,
something never

14
00:00:23,836 --> 00:00:25,298
found on Mars
before.

15
00:00:25,623 --> 00:00:26,726
You had to be
on the ground

16
00:00:26,773 --> 00:00:27,539
to see it.
